{
  "_comment": "Pins the require_vote_quorum conjunct of the decline guard for a vote-authorized negative commitment (RFC-MACP-0007 Section 6.2). decision_finalize_decline_quorum_waiver.json pins that an objection-authorized decline is NOT subject to this conjunct; this fixture pins that a vote-authorized one IS.",
  "description": "Decision Mode: a vote-authorized negative commitment is denied until the voting quorum is met, even with decisive REJECTs cast.",
  "mode": "macp.mode.decision.v1",
  "initiator": "agent://orchestrator",
  "participants": [
    "agent://orchestrator",
    "agent://a",
    "agent://b",
    "agent://c"
  ],
  "mode_version": "1.0.0",
  "configuration_version": "cfg-1",
  "policy": {
    "policy_id": "policy.decision.decline-guard-quorum",
    "mode": "macp.mode.decision.v1",
    "schema_version": 3,
    "description": "Majority vote with a count-3 participation floor and require_vote_quorum.",
    "rules": {
      "voting": {
        "algorithm": "majority",
        "quorum": {
          "type": "count",
          "value": 3
        }
      },
      "commitment": {
        "authority": "initiator_only",
        "require_vote_quorum": true
      }
    }
  },
  "policy_version": "policy.decision.decline-guard-quorum",
  "ttl_ms": 60000,
  "messages": [
    {
      "sender": "agent://orchestrator",
      "message_type": "Proposal",
      "payload_type": "macp.modes.decision.v1.ProposalPayload",
      "payload": {
        "proposal_id": "p1",
        "option": "deploy",
        "rationale": "ready",
        "supporting_data": []
      },
      "expect": "accept"
    },
    {
      "sender": "agent://c",
      "message_type": "Vote",
      "payload_type": "macp.modes.decision.v1.VotePayload",
      "payload": {
        "proposal_id": "p1",
        "vote": "REJECT",
        "reason": "ballot"
      },
      "expect": "accept"
    },
    {
      "_comment": "THE DISCRIMINATOR. One decisive REJECT has been cast, so the tally is Failed and the decline guard's reject_count > 0 conjunct holds. require_vote_quorum is true and the count-3 quorum is unmet (one vote), so the guard's second conjunct fails and this vote-authorized negative commitment MUST be denied (RFC-MACP-0007 Section 6.2, Decline guard). A runtime that checks only reject_count accepts this message and fails the fixture. No objection is recorded, so the decline cannot be objection-authorized.",
      "sender": "agent://orchestrator",
      "message_type": "Commitment",
      "payload_type": "macp.v1.CommitmentPayload",
      "payload": {
        "commitment_id": "c1",
        "outcome_positive": false,
        "action": "decision.rejected",
        "authority_scope": "test",
        "reason": "commit",
        "mode_version": "1.0.0",
        "policy_version": "policy.decision.decline-guard-quorum",
        "configuration_version": "cfg-1"
      },
      "expect": "reject",
      "expected_error_code": "POLICY_DENIED"
    },
    {
      "sender": "agent://a",
      "message_type": "Vote",
      "payload_type": "macp.modes.decision.v1.VotePayload",
      "payload": {
        "proposal_id": "p1",
        "vote": "REJECT",
        "reason": "ballot"
      },
      "expect": "accept"
    },
    {
      "_comment": "Two votes cast: the count-3 quorum is still unmet.",
      "sender": "agent://orchestrator",
      "message_type": "Commitment",
      "payload_type": "macp.v1.CommitmentPayload",
      "payload": {
        "commitment_id": "c2",
        "outcome_positive": false,
        "action": "decision.rejected",
        "authority_scope": "test",
        "reason": "commit",
        "mode_version": "1.0.0",
        "policy_version": "policy.decision.decline-guard-quorum",
        "configuration_version": "cfg-1"
      },
      "expect": "reject",
      "expected_error_code": "POLICY_DENIED"
    },
    {
      "sender": "agent://b",
      "message_type": "Vote",
      "payload_type": "macp.modes.decision.v1.VotePayload",
      "payload": {
        "proposal_id": "p1",
        "vote": "REJECT",
        "reason": "ballot"
      },
      "expect": "accept"
    },
    {
      "_comment": "Three votes cast: the quorum is met and the tally holds decisive REJECTs, so both conjuncts of the decline guard hold.",
      "sender": "agent://orchestrator",
      "message_type": "Commitment",
      "payload_type": "macp.v1.CommitmentPayload",
      "payload": {
        "commitment_id": "c3",
        "outcome_positive": false,
        "action": "decision.rejected",
        "authority_scope": "test",
        "reason": "commit",
        "mode_version": "1.0.0",
        "policy_version": "policy.decision.decline-guard-quorum",
        "configuration_version": "cfg-1"
      },
      "expect": "accept"
    }
  ],
  "expected_final_state": "Resolved",
  "expect_resolution_present": true,
  "expected_resolution": {
    "action": "decision.rejected",
    "mode_version": "1.0.0",
    "configuration_version": "cfg-1",
    "outcome_positive": false
  },
  "expected_mode_state": {
    "phase": "Committed",
    "votes": {
      "p1": {
        "agent://a": {
          "vote": "REJECT"
        },
        "agent://b": {
          "vote": "REJECT"
        },
        "agent://c": {
          "vote": "REJECT"
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
